        "answer": {
          "short": "$-30$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}3\\frac{1}{3}\\times(-9)&=\\frac{10}{3}\\times(-9)\\\\3\\frac{1}{3}\\times(-9)&=-\\frac{90}{3}\\\\3\\frac{1}{3}\\times(-9)&=-30\\end{aligned}$$",
