        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\frac{3}{10}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{4}\\times\\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\times\\frac{1}{2}&=-\\frac{12}{20}\\times\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\frac{3}{4}\\times\\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\times\\frac{1}{2}&=-\\frac{3}{5}\\times\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\frac{3}{4}\\times\\left(-\\frac{4}{5}\\right)\\times\\frac{1}{2}&=-\\frac{3}{10}\\end{aligned}$$",
